{"h":"<h3>🏃关于</h3><p>这是 Qwen Image Edit 2511 的稳定工作流程，它使用令人惊叹的 Lugoli KSampler 和潜在掩模，以消除像素漂移（希望如此）</p><h3>💻我的规格</h3><ul><li><p>🔥GPU - RTX 5070 12GB</p></li><li><p>📦RAM - 48 GB RAM DDR5 6000</p></li><li><p>🧠CPU - 锐龙 7500F</p></li></ul><h3>🌐模型链接</h3><p>在工作流程中</p><h3>📖使用方法</h3><p>1) 负载<strong>图片1，</strong>输出图像的大小将与 image1 中的相同。</p><p>2）选择型号，一般<strong>正常</strong>更好，除非你想要<strong>国家科学基金会</strong>。如果您想要减少像素漂移，请启用 Latent Mask。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/1b48add0-c8a3-432f-9133-12b533f9ec1d/original=true/1b48add0-c8a3-432f-9133-12b533f9ec1d.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>2）画一个面具<strong>图片1，</strong>如果你启用了<strong>潜伏掩模</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/82ec031c-891f-4d23-856c-924f8df6c920/original=true/82ec031c-891f-4d23-856c-924f8df6c920.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/30474a06-83ad-4900-95aa-e9fc52e01f18/original=true/30474a06-83ad-4900-95aa-e9fc52e01f18.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>3）写一个提示</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/20cf5682-839f-47ea-948a-358018c62b55/original=true/20cf5682-839f-47ea-948a-358018c62b55.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>4）点击<strong>运行</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/31601c85-3c8a-448a-87b7-6b2e124e234e/original=true/31601c85-3c8a-448a-87b7-6b2e124e234e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<h3>🏃About</h3><p>This is stable workflow for Qwen Image Edit 2511, it uses amazing lugoli KSampler with latent mask, to eliminate pixel drift (hopefully)</p><h3>💻My specs</h3><ul><li><p>🔥GPU - RTX 5070 12GB</p></li><li><p>📦RAM - 48 GB RAM DDR5 6000</p></li><li><p>🧠CPU - Ryzen 7500F</p></li></ul><h3>🌐Model links</h3><p>In workflow</p><h3>📖How to use</h3><p>1) Load<strong>image1,</strong>size of output image will be the same as in image1.</p><p>2) Choose model, generally<strong>Normal</strong>is better, unless you want<strong>NSFW</strong>. And enable Latent Mask if you want less pixel drift.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/1b48add0-c8a3-432f-9133-12b533f9ec1d/original=true/1b48add0-c8a3-432f-9133-12b533f9ec1d.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>2) Draw a mask in<strong>image1,</strong>if you enabled<strong>Latent Mask</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/82ec031c-891f-4d23-856c-924f8df6c920/original=true/82ec031c-891f-4d23-856c-924f8df6c920.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/30474a06-83ad-4900-95aa-e9fc52e01f18/original=true/30474a06-83ad-4900-95aa-e9fc52e01f18.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>3) Write a prompt</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/20cf5682-839f-47ea-948a-358018c62b55/original=true/20cf5682-839f-47ea-948a-358018c62b55.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>4) Click<strong>Run</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/31601c85-3c8a-448a-87b7-6b2e124e234e/original=true/31601c85-3c8a-448a-87b7-6b2e124e234e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>"}}